{"title":"Korea Trip 2026","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Korea Trip 2026"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"trip-hero\">\n  <div class=\"dates\">July 26 – August 9, 2026</div>\n  <h1>🇰🇷 Korea 2026</h1>\n  <div class=\"subtitle\">Seoul &nbsp;·&nbsp; Jeju &nbsp;·&nbsp; Busan &nbsp;·&nbsp; 15 days of food, culture & adventure</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"stats-row\">\n  <div class=\"stat-card\">\n    <div class=\"stat-number\">15</div>\n    <div class=\"stat-label\">Days</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stat-card\">\n    <div class=\"stat-number\">3</div>\n    <div class=\"stat-label\">Cities</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stat-card\">\n    <div class=\"stat-number\">4</div>\n    <div class=\"stat-label\">Flights</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stat-card\">\n    <div class=\"stat-number\">30+</div>\n    <div class=\"stat-label\">Meals</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stat-card\">\n    <div class=\"stat-number\">∞</div>\n    <div class=\"stat-label\">Memories</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- Overview Map -->\n<div class=\"section-header\">Trip Route</div>\n<div id=\"overview-map\" class=\"day-map overview-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('overview-map').setView([36.5, 127.8], 7);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OpenStreetMap</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n\n  function dot(color) {\n    return L.divIcon({\n      className: '',\n      html: '<div style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:' + color + ';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\"></div>',\n      iconSize: [14, 14], iconAnchor: [7, 7], popupAnchor: [0, -10]\n    });\n  }\n  function hotelDot() {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A148C;border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1;color:#fff\">★</div>', iconSize:[22,22], iconAnchor:[11,11], popupAnchor:[0,-13] });\n  }\n\n  var cities = [\n    { name: '✈️ Vancouver (YVR) → Seoul', lat: 37.5547, lng: 126.9706, color: '#C62828', url: '' },\n    { name: '🏨 Seoul · Shilla Stay Seodaemun\\nJul 27–30', lat: 37.5572, lng: 126.9680, hotel: true, url: 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shilla+Stay+Seodaemun+Seoul' },\n    { name: '🌸 Myeongdong', lat: 37.5636, lng: 126.9834, color: '#E53935', url: 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Myeongdong+Seoul' },\n    { name: '🛍️ Garosugil / Sinsa · Gangnam', lat: 37.5178, lng: 127.0194, color: '#E53935', url: 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Garosugil+Sinsa+Seoul' },\n    { name: '👘 Gyeongbokgung Palace', lat: 37.5796, lng: 126.9770, color: '#E53935', url: 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gyeongbokgung+Palace' },\n    { name: '🪖 DMZ', lat: 37.9355, lng: 126.6783, color: '#795548', url: 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=DMZ+Korea' },\n    { name: '🏨 Jeju · Grabel Hotel\\nJul 31–Aug 3', lat: 33.4996, lng: 126.5312, hotel: true, url: 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Grabel+Hotel+Jeju' },\n    { name: '🌅 Seongsan Ilchulbong', lat: 33.4583, lng: 126.9422, color: '#1976D2', url: 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Seongsan+Ilchulbong' },\n    { name: '🕍 Manjanggul Cave', lat: 33.5280, lng: 126.7718, color: '#1976D2', url: 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Manjanggul+Cave+Jeju' },\n    { name: '🍵 Osulloc Tea Museum', lat: 33.3059, lng: 126.2892, color: '#1976D2', url: 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Osulloc+Tea+Museum+Jeju' },\n    { name: '🏨 Busan · L7 Haeundae by Lotte Hotels\\nAug 4–6', lat: 35.1620, lng: 129.1601, hotel: true, url: 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=L7+Haeundae+by+Lotte+Hotels+Busan' },\n    { name: '🎨 Gamcheon Culture Village', lat: 35.0975, lng: 129.0147, color: '#43A047', url: 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gamcheon+Culture+Village+Busan' },\n    { name: '🚄 KTX → Seoul', lat: 35.1010, lng: 129.0375, color: '#795548', url: '' },\n    { name: '🏨 Seoul · Shilla Stay Seodaemun\\nAug 7–9', lat: 37.5572, lng: 126.9680, hotel: true, url: 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shilla+Stay+Seodaemun+Seoul+Station' },\n    { name: '📚 COEX · Starfield Library', lat: 37.5126, lng: 127.0594, color: '#8B0000', url: 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=COEX+Seoul' },\n    { name: '🌃 Lotte World Tower', lat: 37.5126, lng: 127.1021, color: '#8B0000', url: 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lotte+World+Tower+Seoul' },\n  ];\n\n  cities.forEach(function(c) {\n    var m = L.marker([c.lat, c.lng], { icon: c.hotel ? hotelDot() : dot(c.color) }).addTo(map);\n    var html = '<b>' + c.name.replace(/\\n/g,'<br>') + '</b>';\n    if (c.url) html += '<br><a href=\"' + c.url + '\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Open in Maps →</a>';\n    m.bindPopup(html);\n  });\n\n  // Draw rough route line\n  var route = cities.map(function(c) { return [c.lat, c.lng]; });\n  L.polyline(route, { color: '#C62828', weight: 2, opacity: 0.4, dashArray: '6,6' }).addTo(map);\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Day by Day</div>\n\n<div class=\"day-grid\">\n  <a href=\"days/jul-26.html\" class=\"day-tile seoul\">\n    <div class=\"tile-emoji\">✈️</div>\n    <div class=\"tile-date\">Sun · Jul 26</div>\n    <div class=\"tile-title\">Departure from Vancouver</div>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"days/jul-27.html\" class=\"day-tile seoul\">\n    <div class=\"tile-emoji\">🛬</div>\n    <div class=\"tile-date\">Mon · Jul 27</div>\n    <div class=\"tile-title\">Arrive Seoul · Myeongdong</div>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"days/jul-28.html\" class=\"day-tile seoul\">\n    <div class=\"tile-emoji\">💅</div>\n    <div class=\"tile-date\">Tue · Jul 28</div>\n    <div class=\"tile-title\">Gangnam Da